<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <title>Bulls Boxing - Registro</title>
  <%- include('partials/head') %>
</head>
<body>
  <section class="hero hero-photo" style="background-image: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(20,16,13,0.50) 0%, rgba(20,16,13,0.75) 55%, #14100d 100%), url('/img/gym/hero-fight.jpg');">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <div class="brand-bar">
        <span class="tag">&#129354; Bulls Training &mdash; La Serena / Coquimbo</span>
        <a class="ig-link" href="https://www.instagram.com/bulls_training/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">&#128247; @bulls_training</a>
      </div>
      <p class="hero-kicker">Plataforma de Pronosticos de Boxeo</p>
      <h1 class="hero-title">
        Entra al ring.<br>
        Confia en tu olfato.<br>
        <span class="accent">Gana con Bulls.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">
        Cada pronostico es un golpe. Cada acierto, una victoria. Registrate,
        entrena tu instinto y vive cada pelea con la misma garra de quien sube al cuadrilatero.
      </p>
      <a href="#form-registro" class="btn-cta">&#129354; Quiero participar ahora</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="spotlight">
    <div class="spotlight-card">
      <img src="/img/gym/champion.jpg" alt="Campeon de Bulls Training">
      <div class="spotlight-text">
        <p class="spotlight-kicker">Hecho en Bulls Training</p>
        <h3>Asi se forjan los campeones en La Serena</h3>
        <p class="muted">Pronostica sobre peleadores reales que se entrenan en este gimnasio, camino al cinturon.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="spotlight-card reverse">
      <img src="/img/gym/gym-ring.jpg" alt="Cuadrilatero Bulls Training">
      <div class="spotlight-text">
        <p class="spotlight-kicker">El cuadrilatero real</p>
        <h3>Las peleas que pronosticas suceden aqui</h3>
        <p class="muted">Costales, sogas, sudor y disciplina: la energia de Bulls Training detras de cada pronostico.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="container">
    <% if (error) { %>
      <div class="alert alert-error"><%= error %></div>
    <% } %>

    <div class="steps-bar">
      <div class="step-item step-active">
        <div class="step-circle">1</div>
        <span class="step-label">Completa el formulario</span>
      </div>
      <div class="step-line"></div>
      <div class="step-item">
        <div class="step-circle">2</div>
        <span class="step-label">Transfiere los Bulls</span>
      </div>
      <div class="step-line"></div>
      <div class="step-item">
        <div class="step-circle">3</div>
        <span class="step-label">Recibe tu link de acceso</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2 id="form-registro" class="form-heading">&#129354; Completa tus datos</h2>

    <form method="post" action="/registro" class="card" onsubmit="this.querySelector('button[type=submit]').disabled=true; this.querySelector('button[type=submit]').textContent='Enviando...';">
      <label>Nombre completo
        <input type="text" name="name" required autocomplete="name">
      </label>
      <label>RUT
        <input type="text" name="rut" required placeholder="12.345.678-9" autocomplete="off">
      </label>
      <label>Direccion
        <input type="text" name="address" required autocomplete="street-address">
      </label>
      <label>Correo electronico
        <input type="email" name="email" required autocomplete="email">
      </label>
      <label>Telefono
        <input type="tel" name="phone" required autocomplete="tel" placeholder="+56 9 XXXX XXXX">
      </label>
      <label>Comentarios (opcional)
        <textarea name="comments" rows="3" placeholder="Dejanos saber cuanto quieres participar..."></textarea>
      </label>

      <div class="transfer-card">
        <div class="transfer-card-title">&#128197; Paso 2 &mdash; Transfiere los Bulls</div>
        <p class="transfer-card-desc">Una vez enviado el formulario, realiza la transferencia con el monto de Bulls que deseas y envia el comprobante por WhatsApp.</p>
        <div class="transfer-grid">
          <div class="transfer-row"><span class="transfer-label">Empresa</span><span class="transfer-value">INAREJO Y FUENTES SpA</span></div>
          <div class="transfer-row"><span class="transfer-label">RUT</span><span class="transfer-value">78.078.914-K</span></div>
          <div class="transfer-row"><span class="transfer-label">Banco</span><span class="transfer-value">Banco de Chile</span></div>
          <div class="transfer-row"><span class="transfer-label">Tipo</span><span class="transfer-value">Cuenta Corriente</span></div>
          <div class="transfer-row"><span class="transfer-label">N&deg; cuenta</span><span class="transfer-value tf-highlight">00-122-15632-03</span></div>
          <div class="transfer-row"><span class="transfer-label">Correo</span><span class="transfer-value">Infobullstraining@gmail.com</span></div>
        </div>
        <a href="https://wa.me/56990655586" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="whatsapp-btn">
          &#128172; Enviar comprobante por WhatsApp
        </a>
      </div>

      <button type="submit">&#129354; Enviar mis datos</button>
    </form>

    <p class="muted operator-info" style="margin-top:24px;">
      Plataforma operada por <strong>INAREJO Y FUENTES SpA</strong> &mdash; RUT 78.078.914-K &mdash; Contacto: Infobullstraining@gmail.com
    </p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
